Resources:
- Scrap metal.
- Iron ore.
- Rare equipment.
- Lootable containers.
- Old weapon components.

Threats:
- Gloom Stalkers.
- Stronger crawler groups.
- Territorial enemies.

Purpose:
Introduce better equipment, stronger defenses, and increasingly dangerous expeditions.

### ZONE 3 — THE SUNKEN MIRE & DEEP PINES

Difficulty: High.

Environment:
- Deep forests.
- Thick fog.
- Waterlogged terrain.
- Strange glowing vegetation.
- Unusual underground formations.

Resources:
- Rare medicinal herbs.
- Shard crystal clusters.
- Advanced crafting materials.
- Ancient remains.

Threats:
- Timber Brute nests.
