Connect the open-world mystery to the existing central village television monitor.

Discoveries here should gradually explain what happened to the world and why the monsters are attacking.

### Exploration requirements

Do not make zones feel like empty decorative backgrounds.

Every zone should contain:
- Discoverable locations.
- Functional resource nodes.
- Environmental storytelling.
- Hidden loot.
- Enemy encounters.
- Distinct visual landmarks.
- Reasons to return after unlocking better equipment.

Use progression to encourage exploration rather than relying on invisible barriers alone.

